Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 CDrive Production Preparation Plan P0 Data Design

@ [data_design_uuid] bd48fdac-0355-4bce-abf6-e0eb4ac46e5b
@ [canonical_uuid] 209c5c94-fd65-4f93-946b-bec56912b29e

& [Request]
  + one closed request binds source signature commits branch remote project observed capacity two junctions four upstream identities namespace provider truth and self-digest
  + namespace is a UUID for plan coordinate derivation only and is explicitly not a commission attempt
  + every digest is cantor_core ContentDigest with algorithm sha256 and lowercase sixty-four-hex value

& [Topology]
  + five ordered roles are scratch candidate evidence lease and ledger
  + scratch has fixed C-drive prefix C:\Project\CantorWorktrees\swa05_b1_cdrive_preflight_
  + candidate evidence lease and ledger are strict scratch descendants and pairwise nonoverlapping
  + neither a D-drive role nor forward-slash Windows alias is admitted

& [OperationCircuit]
  + twelve exact operations carry sequence name effect class prerequisites and postconditions
  + read-only operations never imply their observations occurred live
  + create and Phase3A operations are planned_effect and later_authority_required true
  + final independent replay is read_only and follows planned prepared-receipt emission

& [LedgerPlan]
  + exact fixed ledger length is 512 bytes
  + canonical Unclaimed bytes are a fixed ASCII domain prefix followed by zero padding
  + plan carries only their digest and never writes the bytes

& [Evidence]
  + exact files request.json plan.json verification.json and evidence_manifest.json
  + verifier replays twice and emits one deterministic verification machine form
  + all effect accounts remain zero and physical_preparation_authorized remains false
